Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:36:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] d3d10umd video: D3D11 video processor (exynos-woa 0088, G17
 V6c2) - NV12 -> BGRA/RGBA with scaling and rectangles: NIR compute kernel
 (BT.601/709, studio/full range) into a processor-owned RGBA8 picture, then
 pipe->blit and clear_render_target, no application state touched; all 48 VP
 members implemented

